<odoo>
    <data noupdate="1">
        <!--
            Default Configuration Notes
            ════════════════════════════

            Main Warehouse
            ──────────────
            The system expects a warehouse with the short code "MAINWH" to exist
            as the primary supply warehouse.

            If no warehouse with code "MAINWH" is found, the `main_warehouse_id`
            field on each van must be set manually in the Van form view.

            To create the main warehouse:
              Inventory → Configuration → Warehouses → New
                  Name:  Main Warehouse
                  Short Name: MAINWH

            Van Warehouses
            ──────────────
            For each van (up to 10 initially), create a dedicated warehouse:
              Inventory → Configuration → Warehouses → New
                  Name:  Van 01
                  Short Name: VAN01
              Repeat for VAN02 … VAN10.

            Then create a vansales.van record for each and link:
              - warehouse_id     → the van warehouse (e.g. VAN01)
              - main_warehouse_id → MAINWH
              - user_id          → the assigned driver/salesperson
              - pricelist_retail_id  → Retail pricelist
              - pricelist_wholesale_id → Wholesale pricelist
              - cash_journal_id / bank_journal_id / visa_journal_id / mastercard_journal_id

            Pricelists
            ──────────
            Create two pricelists:
              Sales → Configuration → Pricelists
                1. Retail Pricelist
                2. Wholesale Pricelist
            Enable pricelists: Sales → Configuration → Settings → Pricing → Pricelists.
        -->
    </data>
</odoo>
